name: Rank and File
description: Four Husks and a Lobber share one doorway. Shove the unit in the door back into the queue and two of them die at once.
design: Combat Manoeuvre 2 — the doorway.
design: No pits, no spikes. A sealed chamber with one tile of exit.
retired: Three of five Husks take zero actions in eight rounds; `cb-06` teaches the same shove with the player forming the queue.

